WEBVTT

00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:10.542
Stop it, Kayano! This isn't right!

00:00:10.542 --> 00:00:13.750
I will just... kill this guy.

00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:18.583
Once I put my mind to something,
I just keep on rolling.

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:22.458
She's not acting? Those are her true feelings?

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:25.250
In a mere 10 or 15 seconds of full-out battle,

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.375
her mind is already starting to
be taken over by the tentacles...

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:31.625
It's too late if they've
already taken her over that much.

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:34.000
Whether or not she accomplishes her revenge,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.792
a few minutes after the end of the battle,

00:00:36.792 --> 00:00:38.917
I think she'll die.

00:00:38.917 --> 00:00:40.583
Kayano...

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:44.042
Die! Die! Die!

00:00:44.042 --> 00:00:48.583
--Die! Die! Die!
--Koro Sensei... Kill me...

00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:49.917
Help me...!

00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:57.833
<i>"Wait, just hang on a sec!"</i>

00:00:57.833 --> 00:01:00.833
<i>I scream, but it gets me nowhere</i>

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:03.292
<i>I put all my strength into being afraid of</i>

00:01:03.292 --> 00:01:06.083
<i>The limits that just kept on closing in</i>

00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:08.625
<i>Reality is merciless</i>

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:11.375
<i>And time is especially tricky</i>

00:01:11.375 --> 00:01:16.625
<i>It's like someone's snatching away</i>
<i>the blanket I just can't sleep without</i>

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:22.708
<i>We laughed and fretted</i>

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:27.250
<i>Over silly things, nonsensical things</i>

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:33.375
<i>Once the final bell rings out</i>

00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:37.958
<i>The fun times will be over, too</i>

00:01:37.958 --> 00:01:39.500
<i>Bye-bye, yesterday</i>

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:45.500
<i>365 days' worth of lessons shoved into bags</i>

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.583
<i>Like always, like it's "see you tomorrow"</i>

00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:50.125
<i>Bye-bye, yesterday</i>

00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:54.250
<i>365 days' worth of happenings</i>

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:59.250
<i>If you've made me an adult,</i>
<i>don't be showing me tears</i>

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:00.750
<i>Bye-bye, yesterday</i>

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:04.833
<i>365 days' worth of memories</i>

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:07.333
<i>Even if I grow up some more</i>

00:02:07.333 --> 00:02:10.167
<i>They still won't fade a bit</i>

00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:23.875
"15th Period: Confession Time"
"by Kirara Hazama"

00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:27.458
Die! Die! Die! Die!

00:02:27.458 --> 00:02:28.417
Die!

00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:29.208
Die!

00:02:29.208 --> 00:02:30.375
Die!

00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:33.333
Looks more like
<i>she's </i>gonna die--any minute now.

00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:37.000
Can't we do anything?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.833
Do we just stand by and
watch her get eaten away?

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:42.667
--Class!
--Whoa!

00:02:42.667 --> 00:02:43.875
Koro Sensei?!

00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:45.167
Why just your face?

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:47.125
It's a clone!

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:50.167
I don't have much leeway
with Kayano's ferocious attacks--

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:53.167
it's all I can do to
leave an afterimage of my face!

00:02:53.167 --> 00:02:54.875
Still... that's pretty nifty.

00:02:54.875 --> 00:02:57.875
We have to remove her tentacles ASAP!

00:02:57.875 --> 00:02:59.667
--Die!
--They're only putting off all that abnormal heat

00:02:59.667 --> 00:03:02.708
because she's not giving
any thought to her own survival!

00:03:02.708 --> 00:03:06.625
At this rate, the tentacles will
suck out all her life-force and she'll die!

00:03:06.625 --> 00:03:10.708
<i>But</i>! As long as her bloodlust
matches that of her tentacles,

00:03:10.708 --> 00:03:13.917
they'll be rooted to her nerves,
impossible to remove!

00:03:13.917 --> 00:03:18.458
We don't have the time to
talk her down like we did with Itona!

00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:20.792
Then how can we...

00:03:20.792 --> 00:03:22.542
There's only one way:

00:03:22.542 --> 00:03:25.500
I'll pull them out as we fight.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.375
I'll let her hit my greatest weak spot:

00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:30.500
my heart, located just under my tie.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.250
If it's completely destroyed,

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.125
I'll die.

00:03:34.125 --> 00:03:36.292
If I can make her feel like she did me in,

00:03:36.292 --> 00:03:39.458
her tentacles' bloodlust will weaken
for a moment, if only a bit.

00:03:39.458 --> 00:03:41.833
And in that moment, one of <i>you</i>

00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:45.083
will have to make Kayano forget <i>her </i>bloodlust.

00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:47.833
Forget it? But how?

00:03:47.833 --> 00:03:52.667
Whatever works. Anything to
get her mind off assassination.

00:03:52.667 --> 00:03:55.375
It's the only thing I can't do.

00:03:55.375 --> 00:03:57.958
If the target of her bloodlust
were to try any funny business,

00:03:57.958 --> 00:04:00.208
her bloodlust would only intensify.

00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:02.875
But if you can quell that bloodlust,

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:06.042
the tentacles' bond with her
would momentarily be broken,

00:04:06.042 --> 00:04:09.500
and I might be able to
remove them with minimal damage!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:13.917
And Kayano's tentacles would be
on your heart the whole time?

00:04:13.917 --> 00:04:16.500
Wouldn't you die first?

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.500
If I'm lucky, I'll postpone
that final, fatal moment...

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.167
But I'd say the odds of
me dying first are fifty-fifty.

00:04:22.167 --> 00:04:23.125
No!

00:04:23.125 --> 00:04:24.375
But you know...

00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:28.625
For me, the entire class not being
able to graduate uneventfully

00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:31.125
is even worse than dying.

00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:36.042
What is he even doing?

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:39.958
Telling them to step into
the fray and distract Kaede?

00:04:39.958 --> 00:04:43.083
Does he want those brats to
pull off some kind of parlor trick?

00:04:43.083 --> 00:04:44.208
--Mimura...
--Hmm?

00:04:44.208 --> 00:04:45.333
Play some air guitar.

00:04:45.333 --> 00:04:45.875
Huh?

00:04:45.875 --> 00:04:47.875
Show her your badass skills.

00:04:47.875 --> 00:04:49.500
She'll turn her bloodlust on <i>me</i>!

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:50.625
Look, just do it!

00:04:50.625 --> 00:04:51.708
No way will that work!

00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:53.917
--Then what <i>do </i>we do?
--The clap stunner?

00:04:53.917 --> 00:04:57.333
No. If the wavelength of
her consciousness is that messed up,

00:04:57.333 --> 00:05:01.917
a single clap stunner won't be able
to hit it at the ideal moment.

00:05:01.917 --> 00:05:03.125
Knives...

00:05:03.125 --> 00:05:04.875
Guns...

00:05:04.875 --> 00:05:08.375
All this stuff would just hurt Kayano.

00:05:08.375 --> 00:05:10.792
Isn't there anything else?

00:05:10.792 --> 00:05:13.417
The techniques we mastered in this classroom--

00:05:13.417 --> 00:05:18.083
we learned anything and everything
to make us expert assassins!

00:05:20.167 --> 00:05:23.292
Wait--there <i>is </i>that one killer move...

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.083
Die! Die! Die!

00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:36.542
Gotcha...!

00:05:41.042 --> 00:05:42.500
--I swore to your sister...

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.833
--Let me go!
--I swore to your sister...

00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:47.375
...that I wouldn't let
any of you out of my grasp.

00:05:54.375 --> 00:05:56.083
Nagisa...

00:05:56.083 --> 00:05:57.708
Nagisa...

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:19.917
I can't let you say it, Kayano--
that it was all an act.

00:06:26.042 --> 00:06:31.167
Our memories here...
the fun times we all had together...

00:06:36.208 --> 00:06:44.625
I can't let you say that the only thing
ever on your mind was revenge.

00:06:44.625 --> 00:06:46.292
Koro Sensei?

00:06:46.292 --> 00:06:48.083
Will this work?

00:06:48.083 --> 00:06:49.875
Full marks, Nagisa!

00:06:49.875 --> 00:06:52.125
They'll come out now!

00:07:01.083 --> 00:07:05.375
Does this mean Kayano is all right now?

00:07:05.375 --> 00:07:07.875
Yes... probably.

00:07:07.875 --> 00:07:11.500
She'll need absolute rest for a while.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:16.667
Hey, Prince Charming!
Shutting her down with a kiss, eh? Nice!

00:07:16.667 --> 00:07:20.292
I thought it was a good way
to make her forget her bloodlust.

00:07:20.292 --> 00:07:23.167
I'll apologize to her later.

00:07:23.167 --> 00:07:28.208
Fifteen hits on a ten-second kiss?
You're not there yet.

00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:29.417
"Hits"?

00:07:29.417 --> 00:07:33.250
I trained you on forced,
indiscriminate French kisses.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.417
You should have been able to make 40.

00:07:35.417 --> 00:07:37.708
Hmm. Twenty-five's tight for me.

00:07:37.708 --> 00:07:40.708
--Yeah.
--God, I hate this place.

00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:43.500
I can just about make it to 20.

00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:46.708
Koro Sensei!

00:07:47.458 --> 00:07:53.042
I'm fine. It'll just take a while
for my heart to recover.

00:07:53.042 --> 00:07:56.208
I'm sure there's something
you'd like to hear me say,

00:07:56.208 --> 00:07:59.208
but please, wait just a little longer.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.792
Quit playing up the deathbed angle.

00:08:04.792 --> 00:08:07.792
You're still alive enough to dodge.

00:08:07.792 --> 00:08:09.625
Shiro...

00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:12.000
Useless girl.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:15.458
She'd give her own life
for that revenge narrative of hers--

00:08:15.458 --> 00:08:19.958
you'd think she could have done
a bit better than <i>this</i>.

00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:22.542
You're quite the monster.

00:08:22.542 --> 00:08:27.375
Just how many assassins have you
driven away in a single year?

00:08:27.375 --> 00:08:31.875
But there are still two of them right here.

00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:36.125
I'm the last one.

00:08:36.125 --> 00:08:39.042
You took everything away...

00:08:39.042 --> 00:08:42.708
...and I'll make you pay for it with your life.

00:08:42.708 --> 00:08:47.083
The genius scientist,
with cloaked face and altered voice...

00:08:47.083 --> 00:08:50.667
So it <i>is </i>you... Yanagisawa.

00:08:52.417 --> 00:08:55.542
Come, 2.0.

00:08:55.542 --> 00:09:01.708
March will bring a perfect death
for an accursed life.

00:09:03.208 --> 00:09:05.500
What's with him?

00:09:10.667 --> 00:09:12.917
I...

00:09:12.917 --> 00:09:16.125
Kayano... thank goodness.

00:09:16.125 --> 00:09:18.917
Kayano... are you okay?

00:09:18.917 --> 00:09:20.833
Uh-huh...

00:09:20.833 --> 00:09:22.833
Kayano...

00:09:24.792 --> 00:09:27.833
It was pure bloodlust at first...

00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:31.083
But as I spent time with Koro Sensei,

00:09:31.083 --> 00:09:34.667
I started losing my conviction
in that bloodlust.

00:09:34.667 --> 00:09:39.542
Like, doesn't this teacher have
some circumstances I don't know about?

00:09:39.542 --> 00:09:42.958
And shouldn't I find out
what they are before I kill him?

00:09:42.958 --> 00:09:47.042
But that's when the bloodlust
in my tentacles swelled forth.

00:09:47.042 --> 00:09:49.792
They wouldn't let me <i>not </i>do it.

00:09:51.792 --> 00:09:53.333
How dumb.

00:09:53.333 --> 00:09:56.542
Everyone was genuinely
enjoying their assassinations

00:09:56.542 --> 00:10:01.250
while I wasted the whole year
on plain old revenge.

00:10:03.917 --> 00:10:05.833
Kayano...

00:10:05.833 --> 00:10:09.125
Once you taught me this hairstyle,

00:10:09.125 --> 00:10:13.917
I stopped fretting about my long hair.

00:10:13.917 --> 00:10:15.708
And like you said,

00:10:15.708 --> 00:10:20.708
everyone liked the name "Koro Sensei"
--we've been using it all year.

00:10:20.708 --> 00:10:23.875
It doesn't matter what you were after.

00:10:23.875 --> 00:10:28.250
We all made you our friend, together.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:30.833
No matter how much you suffered on your own,

00:10:30.833 --> 00:10:32.083
we can't let you say it was all an act--

00:10:32.083 --> 00:10:33.042
"My Plan (Secret)"
we can't let you say it was all an act--

00:10:33.042 --> 00:10:33.750
we can't let you say it was all an act--

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:36.792
not all those days you were
smiling right there with us.

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:43.792
Koro Sensei promised to tell us
everything once we were all together.

00:10:43.792 --> 00:10:49.667
He's not a saint. We know
he doesn't always do the right thing.

00:10:49.667 --> 00:10:53.958
But let's hear him out--all of us, together.

00:10:53.958 --> 00:10:55.375
Yeah...

00:10:57.000 --> 00:11:01.708
Thank you... I can stop acting now.

00:11:06.583 --> 00:11:08.875
Koro Sensei...

00:11:08.875 --> 00:11:13.667
Whatever's in your past...
We'll accept it, as long as it's the truth.

00:11:17.542 --> 00:11:23.458
I wanted <i>never </i>to talk about
my past if I could help it.

00:11:23.458 --> 00:11:26.625
But I see I have to.

00:11:26.625 --> 00:11:33.708
I don't want to lose your trust,
the bond we share.

00:11:33.708 --> 00:11:35.667
This past summer, on that southern island,

00:11:35.667 --> 00:11:39.458
Mr. Karasuma said of Miss Irina,

00:11:39.458 --> 00:11:42.750
"The better the assassin,
the broader her skill set."

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:46.125
I think that's relevant here.

00:11:46.125 --> 00:11:51.042
This E Class is the first I've ever taught.

00:11:51.042 --> 00:11:54.042
Even so, I've managed to
teach you just about every subject

00:11:54.042 --> 00:11:57.625
without a hitch.

00:11:57.625 --> 00:12:01.500
Why do you think that is?

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.875
Don't tell me...

00:12:02.875 --> 00:12:04.208
That's right:

00:12:04.208 --> 00:12:10.042
Until two years ago,
I was the assassin known as the Reaper.

00:12:10.042 --> 00:12:12.458
And one more thing...

00:12:12.458 --> 00:12:16.792
Even if you do nothing, I'll die come March.

00:12:16.792 --> 00:12:20.250
Either I die alone or the earth dies with me:

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:24.542
That's the only part of the future
an assassination can change.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:36.208
The super-creature began to speak

00:12:36.208 --> 00:12:39.042
of the human memories he had hidden away.

00:12:40.917 --> 00:12:44.917
"Assassination Classroom, Final Season"
"by Kaede Kayano"

00:12:46.875 --> 00:12:52.000
He grew up trusting only in death.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.583
Born in the ugly world of the slums,

00:12:54.583 --> 00:12:59.958
the only truth he could rely on even as a child

00:12:59.958 --> 00:13:03.000
was that if you kill people, they die.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:08.292
So he chose the path of an assassin.

00:13:08.292 --> 00:13:12.333
It was his calling.

00:13:12.333 --> 00:13:15.583
The mighty he killed with knowledge.

00:13:15.583 --> 00:13:19.083
The intelligent he killed
with strength and skills.

00:13:19.083 --> 00:13:24.292
Those gifted with both he enticed
with his personal magnetism.

00:13:24.292 --> 00:13:26.958
When he had killed a thousand victims,

00:13:26.958 --> 00:13:31.583
he was given the nickname "the Reaper."

00:13:36.417 --> 00:13:38.500
Watch how you handle him.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:43.292
Assume there's a danger
of him killing you in any setting.

00:13:43.292 --> 00:13:47.792
Though this <i>is </i>a pretty sad state
for any assassin to be in.

00:13:48.625 --> 00:13:51.875
Clear-headed and tough-bodied.

00:13:51.875 --> 00:13:55.250
No family registry means
no one will complain if he dies.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:14:01.250
He's perfect for this experiment--
exactly why we got him.

00:14:02.417 --> 00:14:04.583
Listen up, guinea pig.

00:14:04.583 --> 00:14:08.708
The new life of legendary assassin the Reaper

00:14:08.708 --> 00:14:12.917
will consist of day after day of
dawn-to-dusk experiments on your body.

00:14:38.958 --> 00:14:40.792
Wow! Who knew?

00:14:40.792 --> 00:14:44.125
You look like such a kind person!

00:14:44.125 --> 00:14:47.917
Someone pressed into service
as my monitor, eh?

00:14:47.917 --> 00:14:52.083
Right? I won't do anything--
could you get me out of here?

00:14:52.083 --> 00:14:57.125
No can do. If I'm killed, I'll die, y'know.

00:14:57.125 --> 00:14:58.875
This woman...

00:14:58.875 --> 00:15:02.333
I might just be able to use her.

00:15:02.333 --> 00:15:05.375
But there's one thing that's bothering me...

00:15:05.375 --> 00:15:07.792
"The 8/10th"
What's with that shirt?!

00:15:07.792 --> 00:15:11.375
Aguri Yukimura. Nice to meet you!

00:15:12.625 --> 00:15:15.833
ATPase, rebalance phase...

00:15:15.833 --> 00:15:18.292
Give him 40 units of SOD inhibitor.

00:15:18.292 --> 00:15:19.708
Yes, sir.

00:15:24.667 --> 00:15:26.792
They're wide open...

00:15:26.792 --> 00:15:30.417
...but if I kill them now,
it'll just complicate my escape.

00:15:36.792 --> 00:15:38.417
Good job today.

00:15:44.958 --> 00:15:49.333
Let me know once you've
rested a bit and I'll check your vitals.

00:15:51.417 --> 00:15:54.500
Again with the dorky shirts, Miss Yukimura?

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:56.083
Not this one, too?!

00:15:56.083 --> 00:15:59.250
I thought it'd be a breath
of fresh air in your solitary lifestyle!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.458
Honestly, it ticks me off.

00:16:01.458 --> 00:16:03.917
And I like this brand, too...

00:16:03.917 --> 00:16:07.792
They don't go over well
with my students, either.

00:16:07.792 --> 00:16:10.125
--Students?
--Aguri!

00:16:10.125 --> 00:16:12.667
Just how long does a simple data check take?!

00:16:12.667 --> 00:16:15.208
I-I'm sorry, Kotaro--

00:16:17.208 --> 00:16:19.625
I'm only marrying you out of pity,

00:16:19.625 --> 00:16:22.458
since your father's one of our subcontractors!

00:16:22.458 --> 00:16:24.458
Now repay that kindness!

00:16:24.458 --> 00:16:28.750
Follow my orders with utmost effort
and whole-hearted devotion!

00:16:30.083 --> 00:16:33.875
Later, guinea pig...

00:16:33.875 --> 00:16:36.000
See you tomorrow.

00:16:41.292 --> 00:16:45.292
Generating antimatter within life:

00:16:45.292 --> 00:16:49.458
That was the core of Yanagisawa's research.

00:16:49.458 --> 00:16:53.125
He'd splice the particle acceleration cycle
needed to create antimatter

00:16:53.125 --> 00:16:55.417
into the life cycle,

00:16:55.417 --> 00:17:00.333
starting up the cells' engines
with that colossal energy.

00:17:00.333 --> 00:17:02.250
--Yanagisawa?
--Hmm?

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:05.083
My hands and feet are pretty numb.

00:17:05.083 --> 00:17:07.208
And I'm getting chills.

00:17:07.208 --> 00:17:09.292
That's <i>Mr. </i>Yanagisawa!

00:17:09.292 --> 00:17:13.250
Tch. Peripheral neuropathy, eh?

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:15.750
Perhaps we should stop giving the alkaloid?

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:19.292
--If I can skillfully control the experiment myself,
--Yeah. If it starts affecting high-molecular-weight polymerization,

00:17:19.292 --> 00:17:22.208
--I can boost the probability of success even further.
--this'll all be for nothing.

00:17:23.542 --> 00:17:27.542
I'll gain a destructive power
beyond all human reckoning.

00:17:30.708 --> 00:17:34.042
Wow, so much on my checklist today!

00:17:34.042 --> 00:17:36.917
Better hurry it along
or I'll get smacked around again.

00:17:36.917 --> 00:17:39.042
And that's a problem?

00:17:39.042 --> 00:17:40.583
Well, kind of.

00:17:40.583 --> 00:17:45.292
I'm actually a teacher--
I can't be getting stupid.

00:17:45.292 --> 00:17:46.208
A teacher?

00:17:46.208 --> 00:17:47.500
Aguri!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.542
How many times do I have to tell you:
Don't keep me waiting!

00:17:49.542 --> 00:17:51.208
I'm sorry--I'll do it right now!

00:17:51.208 --> 00:17:54.375
Your stamina and your clerical skills
are all you're good for!

00:17:54.375 --> 00:17:57.625
Can't you observe one lousy guinea pig?!

00:17:57.625 --> 00:18:00.125
Maybe I'll have to <i>beat </i>it into--

00:18:08.542 --> 00:18:11.208
Mr. Reaper... what did you do?

00:18:11.208 --> 00:18:13.625
I've immobilized him, that's all.

00:18:13.625 --> 00:18:17.250
Now you can still teach tomorrow, right?

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:22.500
After he had spent about
three months in this place,

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:27.292
the killer and the teacher were
as open to each other as old friends.

00:18:28.708 --> 00:18:30.583
Quadratic equations?

00:18:30.583 --> 00:18:33.875
You have to dress it up
a little more or it'll feel too easy.

00:18:33.875 --> 00:18:37.042
That goes double for
students at a college-prep school.

00:18:37.042 --> 00:18:42.208
Urgh... The professional teacher,
schooled by an assassin...

00:18:42.208 --> 00:18:45.667
You're better suited to be
a teacher than I am, Mr. Reaper.

00:18:45.667 --> 00:18:49.875
Well, I can play a college professor
if work demands it.

00:18:49.875 --> 00:18:54.000
But I'm not cut out for teaching.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:59.792
I had a pupil once... but he betrayed me.

00:18:59.792 --> 00:19:03.000
That's how I wound up here.

00:19:05.917 --> 00:19:10.583
Now the Reaper's name
and all his skills are mine alone.

00:19:10.583 --> 00:19:12.458
And that's not all.

00:19:12.458 --> 00:19:17.458
Lately I've mastered a disguise skill
that even you don't have.

00:19:17.458 --> 00:19:24.042
Farewell, my teacher...
You never did see my face, did you?

00:19:24.042 --> 00:19:26.125
I don't understand.

00:19:26.125 --> 00:19:31.417
I had developed his abilities
and supervised him almost perfectly...

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:36.208
I think I get it.

00:19:36.208 --> 00:19:42.250
Your student probably
just wanted to be seen--by you.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.917
But I <i>did </i>see him.

00:19:44.917 --> 00:19:47.083
Closely observing
someone's abilities and personality

00:19:47.083 --> 00:19:49.708
is key to winning them over.

00:19:53.375 --> 00:19:56.625
Break time's over, guinea pig.

00:19:56.625 --> 00:20:00.833
Get back on the restraint table.
We're doing more testing.

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:05.833
The subject's body is
starting to undergo strange changes.

00:20:05.833 --> 00:20:08.042
Only natural, given the
enormous energy within.

00:20:08.042 --> 00:20:09.292
If he were to rebel...

00:20:09.292 --> 00:20:13.708
If he's planning on making
a run for it, he'll take Aguri hostage.

00:20:13.708 --> 00:20:14.417
Huh?

00:20:14.417 --> 00:20:16.750
She's a docile and
reasonably capable guinea pig

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:19.958
whose death no one would mourn.

00:20:19.958 --> 00:20:25.542
In other words, a sacrifice to gauge his malice.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.208
Rejection response is within expectations.

00:20:35.208 --> 00:20:37.917
You may let him be.

00:20:46.917 --> 00:20:50.542
She was to be a living sacrifice.

00:20:50.542 --> 00:20:55.250
The Reaper was turning into
something that wasn't human.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.375
And though she senses these things...

00:20:57.375 --> 00:21:00.958
...she asks no unnecessary questions.

00:21:07.542 --> 00:21:09.792
Good job again today.

00:21:09.792 --> 00:21:13.917
Once you've rested a bit,
I'll check your vitals.

00:21:13.917 --> 00:21:17.750
Then we can have a chat, like always.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:24.333
She just looks straight ahead
and smiles peacefully. Like always.

00:21:24.333 --> 00:21:31.083
Oh... so <i>this </i>is what "seeing" is.

00:21:31.083 --> 00:21:32.583
Yes, let's.

00:21:32.583 --> 00:21:32.833
<i>In the big window where the dappled sunlight shines gently in</i>
Yes, let's.

00:21:32.833 --> 00:21:35.250
<i>In the big window where the dappled sunlight shines gently in</i>
Where are those exam questions?

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:39.000
<i>In the big window where the dappled sunlight shines gently in</i>
The legendary killer who'd never shown himself to anyone

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:44.583
<i>In the big window where the dappled sunlight shines gently in</i>
knew for the first time the happiness in being seen.

00:21:44.583 --> 00:21:47.667
<i>The day I met you felt so far away</i>
<i>  </i>

00:21:47.667 --> 00:21:50.125
<i>The day I met you felt so far away</i>
The seasons changed yet again.

00:21:50.125 --> 00:21:52.333
<i>The day I met you felt so far away</i>
Her new batch of students

00:21:52.333 --> 00:21:56.542
<i>The day I met you felt so far away</i>
met as Class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High...

00:21:56.542 --> 00:21:58.667
<i>The memories I've arranged little by little keep me warm</i>
met as Class 3-E of Kunugigaoka Junior High...

00:21:58.667 --> 00:22:05.750
<i>The memories I've arranged little by little keep me warm</i>
...two weeks before the crescent moon came to be.

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:19.042
<i>A small room, hearts connecting:</i>
<i>you taught me gently</i>

00:22:19.042 --> 00:22:31.792
<i>Once this season comes for me, I won't be able</i>

00:22:31.792 --> 00:22:37.042
<i>To search out your figure anymore</i>

00:22:37.042 --> 00:22:42.792
<i>I'll never forget</i>

00:22:42.792 --> 00:23:02.059
<i>Until the day I can see you again</i>
